Package: ligandFinder
Type: Package
Title: Finds Ligands for GPCRs
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Kevin Brulois
Maintainer: The package maintainer <kevin.brulois@gmail.com>
Description: Scores candidate peptide-hormone precursor ends across the human secretome with 1-D CNN models of per-residue features, builds the residue database behind them, and renders the protein pages. The AlphaPulldown / AlphaFold-metrics code is the separate package fap.
